WEBVTT

00:17.860 --> 00:24.340
Even if I brandish what little courage I have,

00:24.440 --> 00:31.440
I won't understand the true meaning of strength.

00:32.270 --> 00:39.640
Let's climb up the gentle hill and become a star.

00:39.810 --> 00:42.950
If my wish comes true...

00:42.950 --> 00:49.700
My pain, my love, open up the door ahead...

00:49.700 --> 00:56.420
Just one drop of tears, faster than that one drop.

00:56.420 --> 01:05.930
I want to embrace you, therefore I will overcome my doubts in no time.

01:06.240 --> 01:12.960
This sky is too brilliant, the darkness will soon be gone.

01:13.250 --> 01:23.640
As the radiance hits the Prism, a new dawn has arrived.

01:41.000 --> 01:43.540
Such a nice breeze today.

01:44.120 --> 01:47.250
Well then, today's the day I finally clean this mess.

01:47.480 --> 01:49.250
Here I go, Onii-chan!

02:07.890 --> 02:08.940
That hurt...

02:08.940 --> 02:12.150
Ah! It's bad that he forgot this.

02:12.150 --> 02:16.530
Geez, Onii-chan is useless without Filia.

02:18.280 --> 02:21.530
The Knights' Pride

02:46.220 --> 02:49.640
The Crusade Army, formed around Viella,

02:49.640 --> 02:55.980
went on expeditions to the Sablum Empire a total of six times in the last 180 years.

02:55.980 --> 02:59.820
On a side note, the main commander
of the sixth and last expedition,

02:59.820 --> 03:03.910
Judas, is the commander of the Tempelritter.

03:03.910 --> 03:07.120
However, The Holy Cross Army is still...

03:06.580 --> 03:12.790
Who is that girl? She has the same aura as me. Same aura.

03:21.090 --> 03:23.680
I prefer to be alone.

03:23.680 --> 03:25.810
I'm a shadow.

03:29.390 --> 03:32.310
It won't taste good if you're alone.

03:32.310 --> 03:33.650
Even you...

03:33.650 --> 03:37.820
Right, right. What a nice thing you said there, Hyaweh.

03:37.980 --> 03:40.530
That's really good reasoning.

03:40.950 --> 03:42.030
Huh?

03:42.570 --> 03:44.570
I'm Acty Axel.

03:44.570 --> 03:48.740
I would really like to know more about you.

03:48.740 --> 03:53.080
Putting that aside, would you like to hear the rumor?

03:53.460 --> 03:54.830
Rumor?

03:55.880 --> 03:57.300
I want to know, I want to know!

03:57.300 --> 04:01.090
I've been wondering about it, too, guy over there.

04:01.090 --> 04:04.090
Hey, everyone agrees with me, right?

04:05.970 --> 04:08.310
That's right. You're Windland's...

04:08.640 --> 04:10.270
Huh? Aren't you going to eat?

04:10.270 --> 04:11.680
I'm excusing myself.

04:15.520 --> 04:17.570
She left.

04:26.160 --> 04:29.080
What's with that girl? She's following her like a ghost.

04:29.080 --> 04:31.910
Why didn't Lady Priecia say anything?

04:31.910 --> 04:34.080
This doesn't make sense.

04:40.710 --> 04:42.590
Checking.

04:45.430 --> 04:46.300
Today, too...

04:46.300 --> 04:47.470
the two of them...

04:47.470 --> 04:48.800
went in together, right?

04:52.180 --> 04:55.650
It's safe. Checking finished.

04:56.350 --> 04:59.360
I've said it multiple times, why won't you go out?!

04:59.770 --> 05:02.360
My mission. To protect.

05:02.650 --> 05:05.860
Doesn't your country have something called "manners"?!

05:06.110 --> 05:11.080
If I avert my eyes and something happens to you...

05:23.510 --> 05:26.340
School Headmaster

05:26.590 --> 05:29.350
That girl! Who is she really?!

05:29.720 --> 05:32.060
Even if you ask who she is,

05:32.060 --> 05:35.390
just like Kagura has said, she's just doing her mission.

05:35.390 --> 05:37.900
Is there any other reason?

05:37.900 --> 05:39.060
No, there's none.

05:39.400 --> 05:40.570
Full stop.

05:42.570 --> 05:45.570
The way she's doing her mission is problematic!

05:45.570 --> 05:51.580
Thanks to that girl following me day
and night, others are starting to...

05:51.870 --> 05:52.580
Others?

05:53.700 --> 05:54.580
It's nothing.

05:55.000 --> 05:59.500
From olden times until now, has anyone else given the same level of protection as Kagura?

05:59.500 --> 06:00.920
No, there's no one.

06:00.920 --> 06:03.300
That's enough of the full stop.

06:03.300 --> 06:07.510
Don't be so angry. Kagura is risking her life to protect you.

06:07.510 --> 06:09.970
That's why she came here from the Country of Peace.

06:11.470 --> 06:13.470
<i>Risking her life...</i>

06:13.680 --> 06:17.640
Everything is for the sake of winning this war.

06:17.640 --> 06:19.480
You understand what that means, right?

06:19.980 --> 06:21.440
I understand.

06:21.440 --> 06:22.980
I understand, but...

06:23.360 --> 06:26.690
How about if you just enjoy the situation?

06:26.690 --> 06:27.740
Okay?

06:37.580 --> 06:39.250
Enjoy it, eh?

06:42.500 --> 06:47.380
Could it be that there is a special relationship between her and Lady Priecia?

06:47.380 --> 06:49.340
What do you mean by "special relationship"?

06:49.340 --> 06:51.590
I couldn't possibly answer that myself.

06:51.590 --> 06:53.470
It really makes people feel excited, right?

06:56.520 --> 06:58.480
Leave me alone.

07:01.480 --> 07:05.690
Don't follow me! I feel pressured with you around me.

07:06.440 --> 07:08.990
You shouldn't say it like that.

07:09.110 --> 07:11.160
You again?!

07:11.160 --> 07:16.080
Even though I'm unsure of the situation, isn't she just worried about you?

07:16.080 --> 07:18.000
There are still those ninja incidents from before...

07:18.330 --> 07:21.000
Can't you be nicer to her?

07:21.670 --> 07:24.840
Your involvement is also giving me a headache.

07:24.840 --> 07:25.670
Leave me alone!

07:25.670 --> 07:27.010
W-Wait a minute!

07:31.180 --> 07:34.600
Nobody gets close to me anymore, understand?

07:38.180 --> 07:39.270
Let go!

07:39.270 --> 07:41.850
Hey, why are you always angry?

07:41.980 --> 07:43.900
I said let go of me!

07:45.400 --> 07:47.110
Onii-chan!

07:49.320 --> 07:50.740
Filia?

07:52.070 --> 07:54.280
W-What are you doing here?

07:54.450 --> 07:55.780
You forgot this.

07:55.780 --> 07:57.120
Forgot?

07:57.120 --> 07:59.080
Yes, Onii-chan's important-

07:59.080 --> 08:00.290
W-W-Wait a second, Filia!

08:06.540 --> 08:08.300
Ala-Gladius.

08:08.630 --> 08:11.720
It's lucky that Filia brought it here, right?

08:11.720 --> 08:12.510
Yeah.

08:12.630 --> 08:15.510
So, who was that girl just now?!

08:16.010 --> 08:17.720
J-Just now?

08:17.720 --> 08:20.270
You two were holding hands.

08:20.270 --> 08:21.520
She's called Priecia.

08:23.060 --> 08:25.060
So she's Priecia, huh?

08:25.060 --> 08:26.150
Onii-chan.

08:26.150 --> 08:27.570
Y-Yes!

08:28.360 --> 08:32.530
Since you can suddenly doze off, you should be careful about forgetting things, all right?

08:33.200 --> 08:37.030
<i>Filia, as usual, you jump from topic to topic.</i>

08:37.030 --> 08:38.580
Yeah, I'll be careful of that.

08:40.290 --> 08:44.750
That's why I said that Onii-chan would have problems without Filia's help.

08:44.750 --> 08:46.290
N-Nothing of the sort.

08:46.290 --> 08:48.380
There is!

08:48.380 --> 08:51.590
That is why I just decided this.

08:52.380 --> 08:53.590
Decided what?

08:53.760 --> 08:56.720
Filia has decided to work at the academy.

08:56.720 --> 08:59.100
I've become a special elementary student.

09:00.180 --> 09:06.020
In other words, I'll be helping out around here while studying.

09:06.020 --> 09:08.060
It's a nice match for Filia, right?

09:08.060 --> 09:12.610
With this, my care for Onii-chan will be perfect!

09:15.070 --> 09:17.120
Just do what you want.

09:17.450 --> 09:21.410
Yeah, that's why starting today, I'll be staying at Onii-chan's place, all right?

09:44.640 --> 09:47.900
Um, my sister arrived here today.

09:47.900 --> 09:51.070
Since she's staying in my room, I have nowhere else to go.

09:51.270 --> 09:54.860
I'm trying to find a place to sleep.

09:58.070 --> 09:59.870
Um, you there...

09:59.870 --> 10:03.330
Why are you always looking at Priecia?

10:04.500 --> 10:07.080
It's okay if you don't want to answer.

10:07.080 --> 10:09.420
It's for Lady Priecia.

10:09.420 --> 10:12.590
Is that so? But if you don't take a break...

10:15.880 --> 10:20.090
If you want to rest, just let me know and I'll lend you my pillow and blanket.

10:38.650 --> 10:42.240
After saying so, I've changed my mind.

10:42.530 --> 10:45.910
You're fulfilling your mission loyally.

10:45.910 --> 10:48.540
Then, just protect me with all your might.

10:49.250 --> 10:51.040
But there's a condition.

10:52.080 --> 10:54.130
Have a duel with me!

10:54.130 --> 10:57.170
Using weapons that we're familar with.

10:57.170 --> 10:59.470
However, magic is forbidden.

10:59.800 --> 11:03.050
If I win, I won't force you to stop protecting me,

11:03.050 --> 11:05.470
but you'll have to protect me from further away.

11:06.060 --> 11:10.480
If you win, you can continue to protect me like before.

11:13.730 --> 11:17.400
We'll have the duel today after school in the stadium ruins.

11:17.400 --> 11:21.990
I'd like to spend some time training before the duel. Is that all right with you?

11:22.370 --> 11:23.490
Yes.

11:23.490 --> 11:26.120
Okay. See you after school then.

11:41.510 --> 11:43.850
Duel? This is something worth seeing.

11:43.850 --> 11:45.930
But, magic is forbidden.

11:45.930 --> 11:48.560
That seems pretty retro, but it might be interesting.

11:48.560 --> 11:50.310
Might be pretty interesting?!

11:50.310 --> 11:53.020
It's a real duel between Kagura and Priecia.

11:53.150 --> 11:54.270
Priecia!?

11:54.900 --> 11:56.020
Eh? Who are you?

11:56.820 --> 11:58.230
She's my little sister.

11:58.690 --> 12:02.780
Nice to meet you, I'm Filia. I'm currently working here.

12:03.740 --> 12:06.530
Can you ask your sister to move out of that room?

12:06.530 --> 12:09.290
That room is the heaven of man.

12:09.290 --> 12:11.000
I-I've got it.

12:11.000 --> 12:15.540
Besides, I think I heard something about Priecia and the duel.

12:15.540 --> 12:17.300
It's not a duel, it's a competition.

12:17.460 --> 12:19.800
Aren't they the same?

12:20.670 --> 12:22.220
I think they're different.

12:22.220 --> 12:24.930
Filia hopes that Kagura will win, all right?

12:24.930 --> 12:26.800
Why's that?

12:26.800 --> 12:30.600
Do you have any reasons not to cheer for Priecia?

12:34.310 --> 12:35.480
Oh, that's right!

12:35.480 --> 12:38.530
Since they're having a duel, why not have a cheering party before it?

12:38.650 --> 12:40.030
Cheering party?

12:40.400 --> 12:43.200
Kagura's from the Country of Peace, right?

12:43.200 --> 12:47.030
Filia's pretty good at cooking, so let me fix some food from the Country of Peace to heat things up.

12:47.990 --> 12:51.040
According to their customs, this will be something like the Setting Off Ceremony.

12:51.330 --> 12:54.500
This is great, isn't it? Let's do it, Kagura!

12:54.870 --> 12:56.040
Okay.

12:56.170 --> 12:58.460
All right! I'll have to prepare the ingredients quickly.

12:58.460 --> 12:59.500
Let's go, Filia.

12:59.500 --> 13:00.760
Yes.

13:07.890 --> 13:10.390
Lady Priecia!

13:12.640 --> 13:14.980
We've heard about it, Lady Priecia.

13:14.980 --> 13:17.270
A duel with that Miko from the Country of Peace.

13:17.270 --> 13:19.940
Yeah. Where's that Miko now?

13:19.940 --> 13:21.570
We won't see each other until the duel.

13:21.570 --> 13:24.240
Besides, how did you know about it?

13:24.650 --> 13:26.410
Everyone knows about it.

13:26.410 --> 13:28.570
Fel's telling everyone.

13:28.570 --> 13:31.740
It seems like they're having a cheering party now.

13:32.040 --> 13:33.540
Party?

13:34.790 --> 13:36.750
They're really relaxed.

13:37.880 --> 13:39.170
Ta-da!

13:40.670 --> 13:41.920
It's huge!

13:43.510 --> 13:46.260
It looks delicious...

13:46.680 --> 13:48.640
I'm feeling a bit...

13:48.640 --> 13:50.720
Just how can we eat this?

13:50.720 --> 13:52.270
I-I want to go home.

13:52.430 --> 13:54.270
How is it, Kagura?

13:54.270 --> 13:56.770
Do the dishes look like those from the Country of Peace?

14:07.490 --> 14:09.910
How is it? Is it delicious?

14:10.780 --> 14:11.780
Yeah.

14:13.790 --> 14:16.620
Come on everyone, eat up, eat up.

14:16.620 --> 14:18.000
Yes!

14:21.250 --> 14:23.460
<i>Oh, praise Aruke!</i>

14:23.460 --> 14:30.300
<i>This is first time I've had something so delicious since I came to Windland. So delicious!</i>

14:30.300 --> 14:32.640
<i>Then again, I can make use of this situation.</i>

14:32.640 --> 14:38.020
<i>This will be a good opportunity to see if Lady Priecia really is a princess. Good opportunity.</i>

15:01.710 --> 15:02.840
Prepare yourself.

15:05.590 --> 15:08.340
Kagura has the advantage at a distance.

15:08.800 --> 15:12.850
However, Lady Priecia will be faster for the next attack.

15:13.350 --> 15:14.810
Lady Priecia...

15:14.810 --> 15:16.850
Since magic is forbidden,

15:16.850 --> 15:19.850
this is based solely on one's attacking skills.

15:22.400 --> 15:23.860
All right, here I go!

15:57.680 --> 15:58.560
Weak!

16:03.770 --> 16:05.060
The last strike!

16:11.860 --> 16:13.280
Priecia!

16:15.870 --> 16:18.660
All right, nobody's looking.

16:18.660 --> 16:20.410
Oh, Aruke.

16:20.410 --> 16:25.000
I'm grateful that there aren't any eye-witnesses around. Grateful.

16:25.920 --> 16:29.510
Th-They aren't eye-witnesses. They aren't.

16:29.880 --> 16:31.970
I have to calm down... calm down.

16:31.970 --> 16:34.260
This is a chance I can't miss.

16:34.260 --> 16:38.640
If she's really a princess, someone will definitely help her out when she's in a pinch.

16:38.640 --> 16:44.150
I'll just assassinate her in the confusion. Assassinate her!

16:44.150 --> 16:47.360
Saburamu... Faye...

16:53.200 --> 16:54.280
No way!

16:56.370 --> 16:59.330
Oh, Aruke! What a difficult trial for me.

16:59.330 --> 17:02.290
Why am I so clumsy?

17:07.540 --> 17:08.920
What's wrong?

17:08.920 --> 17:10.300
She twisted her ankle.

17:13.220 --> 17:14.970
Wait! Not yet!

17:14.970 --> 17:17.010
There's still no winner yet!

17:26.400 --> 17:28.230
Fire! Fire! Fire!

17:28.730 --> 17:31.070
Everyone, escape now! Quickly!

17:34.490 --> 17:36.910
Lady Priecia, hurry.

17:36.910 --> 17:39.200
I won't leave until there's a winner.

17:44.410 --> 17:46.040
Where's Priecia and Kagura?

17:46.040 --> 17:47.960
They're still inside!

17:48.540 --> 17:49.460
Onii-chan!

17:50.710 --> 17:52.000
Priecia!

17:52.000 --> 17:53.010
Kagura!

17:53.380 --> 17:54.670
Don't get in our way!

17:54.670 --> 17:56.680
I'll lose if I run away.

17:56.680 --> 17:59.510
Now's not the time to say that!

17:59.850 --> 18:00.720
Stop it!

18:01.970 --> 18:03.060
Stop it already!

18:03.060 --> 18:04.640
Leave me alone!

18:08.560 --> 18:10.110
A-Are you all right?

18:10.400 --> 18:11.900
Lady Priecia.

18:11.900 --> 18:13.150
You too.

18:13.480 --> 18:17.660
I'm really foolish to remember about the pain at this time...

18:17.660 --> 18:18.740
Lady Priecia.

18:22.910 --> 18:24.950
Leave me and escape from here.

18:25.040 --> 18:25.660
That's...

18:26.000 --> 18:26.710
Impossible.

18:28.170 --> 18:30.380
We can't waste any lives.

18:30.380 --> 18:31.670
We can't.

18:31.670 --> 18:34.420
Even if it costs me my life, I will protect you.

18:34.960 --> 18:36.170
Kagura...

18:48.310 --> 18:49.480
It didn't work.

18:49.480 --> 18:51.940
We can't do anything at our level.

18:52.820 --> 18:55.150
No one came, even with such a commotion.

18:55.440 --> 18:58.530
Does that mean that Lady Priecia is not the princess?

18:59.240 --> 19:01.410
Onii-chan!

19:01.700 --> 19:03.740
Soujin Enhazan!

19:01.700 --> 19:03.740
Twin Blade, Supreme Flame Slash

19:04.240 --> 19:05.540
Instructor Karin!

19:05.540 --> 19:07.750
What is she trying to do fighting fire with fire?!

19:15.130 --> 19:16.130
Eh?

19:16.130 --> 19:17.300
It extinguished it.

19:17.300 --> 19:24.060
I see. Because of the collision of the fire, the oxygen required to keep it burning was used up.

19:24.060 --> 19:26.270
As expected of the Tempelritter.

19:28.560 --> 19:29.270
That's right!

19:30.850 --> 19:33.480
Onii-chan! Kagura!

19:33.480 --> 19:34.770
Lady Priecia!

19:35.980 --> 19:38.990
Everything ended without any of my doubts being cleared.

19:39.780 --> 19:41.200
It's you again, huh?

19:41.200 --> 19:44.580
Instructor, you should praise Hyaweh this time.

19:44.580 --> 19:48.830
He went into the burning building to save the two who failed to escape in time.

19:50.620 --> 19:51.920
Instructor...

19:52.830 --> 19:54.630
I saved the two of them.

19:54.630 --> 19:55.500
You fool!

19:56.340 --> 19:58.840
Although that was supposed to be noble,

19:58.840 --> 20:02.760
all three of you could have lost your lives!

20:02.760 --> 20:05.390
Are you trying to be a hero?

20:05.510 --> 20:06.510
I...

20:10.020 --> 20:12.270
I didn't do anything wrong.

20:12.270 --> 20:14.610
Okay. It's all right then.

20:14.610 --> 20:18.030
Anyway, can anyone explain to me what caused the fire?

20:19.150 --> 20:22.360
This building has been off-limits for the last few days.

20:22.360 --> 20:25.780
If there's no explanation I'm going to punish every one of you.

20:36.960 --> 20:39.550
Why do we need to pluck the grass too?

20:39.550 --> 20:40.340
Who knows...

20:40.760 --> 20:42.220
Just so you know, Onii-chan,

20:42.220 --> 20:44.340
Filia was really worried about you.

20:45.050 --> 20:46.350
I'm sorry.

20:46.350 --> 20:47.640
Geez...

20:47.640 --> 20:52.810
Oh, Onii-chan, Filia has decided to
stay in Fel's room from now on.

20:53.730 --> 20:55.230
All right!

20:55.230 --> 20:56.610
The heaven of man...

20:56.610 --> 20:58.230
is revived!

20:59.980 --> 21:01.400
Kagura.

21:01.400 --> 21:03.910
It's my loss.

21:03.910 --> 21:06.280
The match is still not decided.

21:06.280 --> 21:11.370
Wanting to continue the duel even when injured...

21:11.370 --> 21:15.250
I really admire you, Lady Priecia.

21:15.580 --> 21:19.750
From now on, I'll protect you... from far away.

21:23.170 --> 21:25.260
Is that it?

21:26.550 --> 21:28.140
I'm grateful to you.

21:29.100 --> 21:31.060
For saving us.

21:31.060 --> 21:33.270
It's all right. I couldn't just leave you there.

21:33.560 --> 21:34.940
Is that so?

21:34.940 --> 21:37.480
Well then, let's finish the cleaning faster.

21:37.480 --> 21:39.270
All right!

21:40.400 --> 21:44.990
I'll definitely find out your true identity one day. True identity!

21:55.880 --> 22:02.110
When the star has fallen and the day becomes night,

22:02.490 --> 22:08.930
will the noise that I heard until yesterday disappear, too?

22:08.930 --> 22:15.720
In this brief moment of gentle wind, the sunlight shining through the trees

22:15.720 --> 22:22.410
gives me warmth in this dull scenery,

22:22.650 --> 22:29.500
so that I will still go on and reach that feeling!

22:30.000 --> 22:37.500
Even if I'm crying, even if I'm painfully wandering.

22:37.500 --> 22:43.430
I believe in your only radiance over there.

22:43.430 --> 22:50.700
Like the mists that shrouded the raining Earth,

22:51.010 --> 22:57.480
if all the meeting can be repeated on this planet,

22:57.730 --> 23:04.930
within this strange power, it will change into a miracle.

23:14.950 --> 23:17.870
Next Episode

23:20.040 --> 23:21.290
Oh...

23:21.290 --> 23:23.710
Everyone's... studying...

23:24.750 --> 23:27.720
Next episode, The Knights' Ordeal.

23:28.630 --> 23:31.800
Shine, the prism of heart!

23:33.180 --> 23:35.430
Lady Priecia...

23:34.560 --> 23:39.060
The Knights' Ordeal

23:35.430 --> 23:37.100
Fight.
